{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survivor-Style Action!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Denrei Survivors</strong> is a 2D pixel art action game that blends <strong>Vampire Survivors-style gameplay</strong> with <strong>roguelite mechanics</strong>, set in a unique cyberpunk world.[/p]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat waves of enemies\u2014<strong>middle-aged men who\u2019ve become Denrei (electric spirits)</strong>\u2014<br>survive against all odds, choose from a variety of weapons and items,<br>and power up your own custom build as you dive deeper into the endless dungeon!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874490/extras/df5eabafaa329eabc24540dcc85f261e.poster.avif?t=1762131201\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874490/extras/df5eabafaa329eabc24540dcc85f261e.webm?t=1762131201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874490/extras/df5eabafaa329eabc24540dcc85f261e.mp4?t=1762131201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Two Runs Are the Same</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each adventure is different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated dungeons, unpredictable enemy patterns, and your choices create a new journey every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luck, growth, and decision-making will define your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874490/extras/cd5545a66cc032bed9d9f4295def59ea.avif?t=1762131201\" width=600 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Madness of the Denrei World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One night, a massive lightning strike hit the Tokyo Skytree, reducing the city to ruins...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That very night, countless middle-aged men vanished\u2014only to return as Denrei, ectoplasmic spirits charged with desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now they wander the streets of Tokyo, transformed into ghostly abominations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the midst of the chaos, a single high school girl miraculously survives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are that girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the power of the Denrei themselves to wipe out these swarming spirits,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and send every last one of them screaming back to heaven!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874490/extras/93746c864d889587adecc6ea4e114aef.avif?t=1762131201\" width=600 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is <strong>Cyberpunk \u00d7 Middle-aged Men \u00d7 High School Girl \u00d7 Roguelite</strong>,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >an <i>ultra-futuristic, over-the-top survivor-style action game</i> like no other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >made with love and determination by a 48-year-old solo developer (except for the music). I truly hope you enjoy it \u2014 your support would mean the world to me!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874490/extras/9aeab688d3d9db4d6a5030dd4a80867d.avif?t=1762131201\" width=600 height=194 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Area1 Cl